*“This town, is coming like a ghost town*\
*All the clubs have been closed down”*

Financial District was really looking like a ghost town on this Halloween night. The power in most of downtown Manhattan is shut down (even though the [Bulgarian bar Mehanata](http://www.mehanata.com/) was working rain or shine or hurricane). Here are some photos.

